OL,3,AReform says it will prioritise
OL,4,ABritish-born young workers for social
OL,5,Ahousing
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK has said it will prioritise
OL,8,FBritish-born workers under 35 when
OL,9,Fallocating social housing if it were to
OL,10,Fenter government.
OL,12,FDeputy leader Richard Tice will set out
OL,13,Fplans to build 50,000 affordable social
OL,14,Fhomes a year in a news conference on
OL,15,FMonday, a policy which the party claims
OL,16,Fwill require no new taxes or borrowing.
OL,18,FOn top of British-born workers, former
OL,19,Fmilitary service personnel and married
OL,20,Fcouples with children will also be
OL,21,Fprioritised, Reform said.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
